reports?   Second, let's turn on debug before calling fit(), i.e.

debug(fit)
debug(fit.ProbeLevelModel)

and then call:

fit(plm, verbose=verbose)

Cut'n'paste every line you get.  You evalute each line of code one by
one by pressing ENTER or n + ENTER.  Now, at what line of code does it
crash?

/Henrik

