Hi Ken,

thanks for this.  I just started to download it using 'wget' and it
reports file size 287,624,402 bytes (274MB).   Since print(cdf) in
Yifang's code reports the CDF file size to be 740.05MB, this most
likely means that the latter is an ASCII CDF.  FYI, in next version of
aroma.affymetrix, print(cdf) will also tell if the CDF file is in an
ASCII or a binary format.

Cheers

Henrik

