I've downloaded the binary MoEx-1_0-st-v1.cdf file that Ken provided
to my 32-bit WinXP Pro  machine w/ 1.5GB RAM on R v2.5.1 Patched
(2007-06-29 r42095) with same setup of packages as you have, and it
works for me.  I've tried both via Rgui and Rterm.  Here is what I
get:

> library(aroma.affymetrix)

> cdf <- AffymetrixCdfFile$fromChipType("MoEx-1_0-st-v1")

> cdf
