Hi, the path generated by getAbsolutePath() is indeed correct
(==expected/as documented), given the context and the pathname in that
last code snippet it was given.  However, that has no implications on
the crash on you experience with readCdfCellIndices() in affxparser.
So don't worry about that one.

/H

