Look at the same URL; I've added an example how to get the
distribution of number of cells per unit for any given CDF.  The
MoEx-1_0-st-v1.CDF has some quite huge units, i.e.

(size, count)
     1:   55335
     2:   34171
     3:   33769
     4: 1133410
