291407:       1

You're paying a huge price in time for fitting those few 1000+ cell
units.  You can specify what units you want to fit using argument
'units' to fit().  I leave that as an exercise to figure out the unit
indices for the units to exclude etc.

/Henrik

On 7/18/07, Henrik Bengtsson <h...@stat.berkeley.edu> wrote:
> Hi,
